Resident dispatch: a zygote parses once and forks a child per request over a unix
socket. The two roles, the reply protocol, and the environment names AMK_ZYGOTE and
AMK_REARM are documented in the block comment in main.c below. The cmsg layout block
exists because Cosmopolitan carries the Linux cmsghdr on every host, and Darwin and
the BSDs lay out descriptor passing differently.

